explanation:
`cy.get(selector).type(text)` types into an input field. It first clears any existing value unless you pass `{ parseSpecialCharChars: false }`.

```
cy.get('#username').type('wizard');
cy.get('#password').type('playwright123');
cy.get('#login-btn').click();
cy.get('#success-message').should('be.visible');
```

Special keys: `.type('{enter}')`, `.type('{tab}')`, `.type('{backspace}')`

