explanation:
Cypress assertions use `.should(chainer, value)`. Chainers wrap Chai assertions:

```
cy.get('h1').should('have.text', 'Hall of Truth');
cy.get('#hero-badge').should('have.class', 'badge-gold');
cy.get('#submit-btn').should('be.disabled');
cy.get('#modal').should('not.exist');
```

Common chainers: `'be.visible'`, `'exist'`, `'contain'`, `'have.text'`, `'have.class'`, `'have.attr'`, `'have.value'`

