explanation:
`cy.screenshot()` takes a screenshot saved to `cypress/screenshots/`. Unlike Playwright, Cypress doesn't return Base64 directly — it saves to disk.

```
cy.screenshot('my-screenshot');
// or with options
cy.screenshot({ capture: 'fullPage' });
```

For element screenshots: `cy.get('#hero').screenshot('hero-card')`

